sunrise-mech-weapon-crate-window-title = Undetermined Mech Weapon Crate
sunrise-mech-weapon-crate-window-description = Select one Cybersun mech weapon package. The toolbox will be replaced with a crate containing the selected equipment.

sunrise-mech-weapon-set-rocket-name = Missile arsenal kit
sunrise-mech-weapon-set-rocket-description = Includes a mounted EXP-220 Duster, SRM-8, BRM-6, and BRM-50 missile racks, a portable cage recharger, and a Syndicate power cage.

sunrise-mech-weapon-set-heavy-rifle-name = Heavy rifle kit
sunrise-mech-weapon-set-heavy-rifle-description = Includes a mounted heavy rifle, a mounted AS-12 "Minotaur" automatic shotgun, a BRM-50 missile rack, and binoculars.

sunrise-mech-weapon-set-uvm31-name = UVM-31 kit
sunrise-mech-weapon-set-uvm31-description = Includes a mounted UVM-31 "Drake" laser minigun, a mounted UVM-51 "Dragon", a biocoded Syndicate elite hardsuit, a draco, and a space dragon figure.

sunrise-mech-weapon-set-kord-name = Kord kit
sunrise-mech-weapon-set-kord-description = Includes a mounted Kord machine gun and an SRM-8 light missile rack.

sunrise-mech-weapon-set-vindictor-name = Vindicator kit
sunrise-mech-weapon-set-vindictor-description = Includes a mounted MG-100 Vindicator minigun and an SRM-8 light missile rack.

sunrise-mech-weapon-set-mg-name = MG support kit
sunrise-mech-weapon-set-mg-description = Includes a mounted MG, a BRM-6 missile rack, an advanced industrial welder, a Syndicate mech HUD, a portable cage recharger, and a Syndicate power cage.
